MODULE: FallbackShipsWholeTree
TARGET: RepairOnlyLocalised
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the bootstrap fallback re-ships rows outside the localised ranges
PERTURBS: Fallback

--- FIND
    /\ inflight' = inflight \cup {RepairMsg(k, aStore[k].ts, aStore[k].del) : k \in FallbackRows}
--- REPLACE
    /\ inflight' = inflight \cup {RepairMsg(k, aStore[k].ts, aStore[k].del) : k \in {j \in Keys : aStore[j].ts > 0}}
--- END
